usage: run_sdk.py [-h] [--seconds SECONDS]
                  [--console-key {F1,F2,F3,F4,F5,F6,F7,F8,F9,F10,F11,F12}]
                  [--reflected] [--leases] [--retained] [--stable-returns]
                  [--object-assignment] [--pod-values] [--enum-values]
                  [--text-values] [--menu-ownership] [--button-references]
                  [--button-actions] [--multi-controls] [--traces]
                  [--keybinds]
                  {objects,example,smoke,console,introspection,management}

Expedition 33 development SDK

positional arguments:
  {objects,example,smoke,console,introspection,management}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --seconds SECONDS     Console duration; 0 runs until Ctrl+C
  --console-key {F1,F2,F3,F4,F5,F6,F7,F8,F9,F10,F11,F12}
                        Optional additional console toggle
  --reflected           Use experimental v6 reflected invocation backend
  --leases              Use experimental v7 object leases and reflected
                        invocation
  --retained            Use experimental v8 retained invocation and Harness
                        values
  --stable-returns      Use experimental v9 stable retained object returns
  --object-assignment   Use experimental v10 owned ObjectProperty assignment
  --pod-values          Use experimental v11 verified numeric struct
                        invocation
  --enum-values         Use experimental v13 byte-enum invocation and v12
                        capabilities
  --text-values         Use experimental v12 owned text invocation and v11
                        capabilities
  --menu-ownership      Use experimental v14 scope-owned menu lifecycle; no
                        finished Mods Menu
  --button-references   Use experimental v15 retained Slate button lifetime;
                        no click callbacks
  --button-actions      Use experimental v16 menu-owned Python button
                        callbacks; no finished Mods Menu
  --multi-controls      Use experimental v17 menu-owned multiple controls; no
                        finished Mods Menu
  --traces              Use experimental v18 scalar native POST traces;
                        broader coverage pending
  --keybinds            Use experimental v19 mod key delivery
